{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Stars of the Valkyrie</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554980/extras/Stars_of_the_Valkyrie_Trailer.gif?t=1743263192\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fly through space shooting down/dodging asteroids and enemy ships, and avoid harming transports. Be careful as giant cruisers will try to shoot you down. Score big and you may find yourself in the top scores.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Endless Runner Action</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554980/extras/2025-02-23_15-09-06.gif?t=1743263192\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play an endless runner like you would an old school style arcade game. With a unique nine lane system that puts action in 3D like never before.\u00a0Get a top score and brag to your friends that you're the best.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unique nine lane movement</strong>, giving you more freedom to dodge and shoot through space</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Scoreboard</strong>, see where you rank against the rest of the world. Can you make the top ten?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">By purchasing<strong> Stars of the Valkyrie</strong>\u00a0you will receive a supporters icon on the top scores and fly through the stars in the supporters ship.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3554980?t=1743263192","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3554980?t=1743263192","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554980/2d6caaf7ae997fdf5b00f6c40c6a4e578f34ff5f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743263192","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554980/2d6caaf7ae997fdf5b00f6